<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Actacorp year net up 17.7pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Actacorp year net up 17.7pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		10.25	  vs	 8.71</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     27.2	   vs	20.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		 305.49	  vs     295.61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  16.88	  vs	15.12</p>
<p>    Minorities		 1.59	  vs	 0.59</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Actacorp Holdings Bhd. It makes chemical products including fertilizers, fuel, weedkillers and other products. -- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
